<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valspar Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valspar Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Valspar Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- expects Valspar to earn $2.95 a share in 1997 and $3.40 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said Valspar is becoming a premier global coatings company and is creating significant potential for incremental revenue and earnings growth.</p>
<p>-- Valspar gained 1/4 to 54-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
